{\footnotesize\bfseries\color{crBlue}Retrofit opportunity\par}
\vspace{0.10cm}
{\small Assume {{eligible_rooms|n}} eligible existing rooms.\par
{{retrofit_adoption|p}}\% annual uptake gives {{retrofit_systems|n}} systems/year.\par}
\vspace{0.12cm}
{\scriptsize Same complete-system ticket; compatibility assumed.\par}
{\large\bfseries\color{darkred}\EUR\,{{retrofit_revenue|m1}} M/year\par}
