Source: \href{https://www.iba-worldwide.com/sites/default/files/2026-03/iba-fy25-results-presentation-en.pdf}{IBA FY{{room_order_year|y}} results: room orders and share}.
Global order estimate rounded before calculating revenue. Orders are not same-year installations; a sustained order-to-delivery rate is assumed.\par
Eligible rooms and uptake are scenario assumptions, not verified demand. Market opportunity is not a company sales forecast; achievable share requires validation.\par
Model: costs/installation\_market.csv.\par}
